{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（30日）中午12時55分，秀茂坪順天邨天瑤樓有住戶報案，指一個低層單位冒煙起火。消防員到場出動一條喉及一隊煙帽隊灌救，約12分鐘後將火救熄。事件中有50人疏散，無人受傷。人員經調查後，初步相信是雜物起火，事發時沒有人在單位內。</p><p>現場可見，涉事單位熏黑，消防員仍然在射水降溫。</p><figure><img alt=\"涉事單位熏黑。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260730/1159490665768292352638951.jpeg/rJOiJi2P3ZepWJ2iCOmKLFAwbhVoGCAnF4mJJzKJiSc\"/><figcaption>涉事單位熏黑。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防員在涉事單位調查。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260730/1159492448414601216413562.jpeg/ntbaJ9DcHLWYMwlaMkMsXAfoYzGgN2Igx3dqReJ3akU\"/><figcaption>消防員在涉事單位調查。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防到場救援。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260730/1159490398930866176062517.jpeg/vE_2GpEEpshj9izV2QtHZeWHUkw_l6OssAVKSJUFSkg\"/><figcaption>消防到場救援。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"居民自行疏散。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260730/1159490401971867648816503.jpeg/aP2O0lyEJV7D0H-osd4piFgkunkJKOUSUCgJ3HUoCdw\"/><figcaption>居民自行疏散。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警員到場調查。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260730/1159490404761210880159386.jpeg/BsNGUfI-XMjKoG71f8Ru-PZtsMRGUfbwoIzDpoWMw6Y\"/><figcaption>警員到場調查。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"涉事單位熏黑。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260730/1159490407605080064346298.jpeg/60jaf_JAh3iOYMXJ8c_-HQvnYv9lV2Hvg9fv6KbX7-g\"/><figcaption>涉事單位熏黑。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防射水灌救。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260730/1159490410272788480540921.jpeg/1YnUHhehbe1gFL9_kgD8EQbC9qjoMPi_6kyjWc9Mo1k\"/><figcaption>消防射水灌救。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防到場救援。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260730/1159490395160186880407618.jpeg/YaK9dvkPzbUJ6RMyirDEKtc5a-KX0AIRvHSlPpl0pT4\"/><figcaption>消防到場救援。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防到場救援。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260730/1159490398004056064049381.jpeg/gcRYyf2QoZYW9rCFHM4hWNU7ZXQjI64HwYAfwOSAH8A\"/><figcaption>消防到場救援。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-30T05:58:51.500666+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":270,"images":9,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}